ew" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOMOYOSE, TETSU</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>AMAYA TOSHIHIKO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>DANZINGER WERNHER M</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IKEDA AKIRA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IMAMURA JUN</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI ATSUSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SAITO KANAME</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOMOYOSE TETSU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AMAYA, TOSHIHIKO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>DANZINGER, WERNHER, M.</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IKEDA, AKIRA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IMAMURA, JUN</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, ATSUSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAITO, KANAME</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOMOYOSE, TETSU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A cement dispersant (especially a dispersant for concretes with ultrahigh performance) comprising as the main component a water-soluble amphoteric copolymer obtained by copolymerizing (A) a polyamide-polyamine or an alkylene oxide adduct thereof with (B) (meth)acrylic acid or an alkali metal, ammonium, or alkanolamine salt thereof and (C) a polyalkylene glycol ester of (meth)acrylic acid in an A/B/C ratio of (10-40)/(10-40)/(50-80) (wt.%); and a concrete composition (especially an ultrahigh-performance concrete) containing the dispersant.  The dispersant satisfies all of a water-reducing effect, slump flow retention, strength development, etc.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispersant pour ciments (notamment un dispersant pour ciments à ultra-hautes performances) comprenant, comme composant principal, un copolymère amphotérique hydro-soluble obtenu par copolymérisation (A) d'un produit d'addition polyamide-polyamine ou oxyde d'alkylène de celui-ci avec (B) de l'acide (méth)acrylique ou un métal alcalin, de l'ammonium ou un sel d'alcanolamine de ceux-ci et (C) un ester glycolique de polyalkylène d'acide (méth)acrylate, selon un rapport A/B/C de (10-40)/(10-40)/(50-80) ( % en poids) ; et une composition cémenteuse (notamment un béton à ultra-hautes performances) contenant le dispersant. Ledit dispersant satisfait aux conditions requises de réduction d'eau, de perte d'affaissement et d'augmentation de résistance du béton.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>